{"id":"849f312d31","t":"En Travesti – I Became a Fake Prince","c":"cv","n":40,"l":40,"s":["ml","mg","az"],"k":{"ml":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince","mg":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince1","az":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince1"},"u":1795077896632,"desc":"ليتيسيا، أصغر سجينة في زنزانة الموت في الإمبراطورية، أُفرج عنها بشرط واحد. كان طلب الإمبراطور الوحيد للإفراج عنها هو: “ستصبحين ابني.” …بعبارة أخرى، لتلعب دور الأمير الأصغر الذي سيُرسل كرهينة إلى الدوقية الكبرى. “ستموتين على أي حال، فموتي كأمير.” ومنذ ذلك اليوم، أصبحت ليتيسيا بوربا أميراً مزيفاً. لتموت مكان الأمير الحقيقي. إن ترافستي (En Travesti): ممثلة تؤدي أدواراً رجالية مرتدية السراويل بدلاً من التنانير.","type":"مانهوا","status":"OnGoing","genres":["دراما","رومانسى","شوجو","فنتازيا","كوميدى"],"src":{"ml":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince","mg":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince1","az":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince1"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince|/manga/en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince/1/","mg":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince1|","az":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince1|/series/en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince1/chapter-1"},"2":{"ml":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince|/manga/en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince/2/","mg":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince1|"},"3":{"ml":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince|/manga/en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince/3/","mg":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince1|"},"4":{"ml":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince|/manga/en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince/4/","mg":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince1|"},"5":{"ml":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince|/manga/en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince/5/","mg":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince1|"},"6":{"ml":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince|/manga/en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince/6/","mg":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince1|"},"7":{"ml":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince|/manga/en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince/7/","mg":"en-travesti-i-became-a-fake-prince1|"},"8":{"ml":"en-travesti-i-bec